    "faq_prDzdd": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_UF7XNB": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What’s included in the WELLFIT 4th Anniversary Sale Celebration?",
            "content": "<p>🏷️ WELLFIT <br/>4th Anniversary Sale Is Here! 🎖️💐<br/><strong>💙🙏 Thank You for 4 Incredible Years of Support and Trust 🎊🏆</strong></p><p>Here’s what you can enjoy during our <strong>4th Anniversary Sale</strong> event:</p><p>✅ <strong>Up to $640 OFF</strong> on select treadmills & walking pads<br/><br/>✅ <strong>30-Day Worry-Free Return</strong> – shop with confidence<br/><br/>✅ Join <strong>50,000+ happy users</strong> and kickstart your wellness journey</p><p>📅 <strong>Limited-time offer valid through July. 1st</strong><br/><br/>Don’t miss your chance to upgrade your home fitness setup this fall!</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_iKP8z4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does the 30-Day Worry-Free Return work?",
            "content": "<p>We want you to feel confident about your purchase. That’s why we offer a <strong>30-day worry-free return period</strong>. WELLFIT will offer custmers a pre-paid return label when <a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\"><strong>applicable</strong></a>. Customers don't need to pay for the return shipping.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_8T8Y6G": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "🎁 Order Early for a Stress-Free Holiday (Christmas Tips)",
            "content": "<p>Buying early means your gift won’t arrive late — and even if the recipient prefers something else, you’ll still have time to switch to a perfect Plan B.<br/>Ordering now also helps you avoid holiday shipping delays and ensures your treadmill arrives well before Christmas.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_hh48Fn": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How fast will my order ship?",
            "content": "<p>Most orders are processed and shipped within <strong>1–2 business days</strong>. You’ll receive tracking information once your item is on the way.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_PFmXD8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I contact customer service?",
            "content": "<p>For any questions or order support from our official website, feel free to reach out:</p><p><strong>Email</strong>: <a>service@wellfittreadmill.com</a><br/><br/><strong>Phone</strong>: +1 (281) 777-8190<br/><br/><strong>Available</strong>: Monday–Friday, 9:00 AM – 3:00 PM (GMT+8)</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_pEJQgx": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long is the warranty for WELLFIT products?",
            "content": "<p>All WELLFIT treadmills and walking pads come with a <strong>1–3 year warranty</strong>, depending on the specific model. We stand behind the quality of our products and are here to support you long after your purchase.</p><p>For full details, please visit our official <a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/warranty-policy\"><strong>Warranty Policy</strong></a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_pVhyBJ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need to pay extra for shipping or taxes?",
            "content": "<p><strong>No, you don't.</strong> All WELLFIT products come with <strong>free shipping and no additional taxes, </strong>consumers <strong>do not need to pay the 7%-15% sales tax</strong>. The price you see on our website is the final price — no hidden fees at checkout.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_JbhjGB": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How soon will I receive my order after purchase?",
            "content": "<p>We ship from <strong>7 U.S. warehouses</strong> located in <strong>California, Georgia, Texas, New Jersey, Houston, and New York. </strong>Most orders are delivered within <strong>1–5 business days</strong>, depending on your location.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_kEj6ja": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does WELLFIT stand for?",
            "content": "<p>WELLFIT was born from a personal journey toward better health—and we’ve grown to support over <strong>30,000+ people</strong> in making fitness not just a routine, but a <strong>lifestyle</strong>. We believe that staying active shouldn’t be a struggle—it should be an empowering, sustainable habit.</p><p>Our vision is to help more people live <strong>healthier, freer lives</strong>, and face each day with energy and optimism.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
